        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.84$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}z&=\\frac{45-50}{5}\\\\&=-1\\end{aligned}$$\nUsing symmetry and the empirical rule,\n$$\\begin{aligned}P(X>45)&=P(z>-1)\\\\&\\approx0.5+\\frac{0.68}{2}\\\\&=0.84.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
